# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository; check out LF on every platform.
#
# This project is developed on Windows and verified on Windows, macOS and Linux
# (AGENTS.md section 5.2), so the working tree must not carry platform-specific
# line endings. Without this, git warns on every Windows checkout and CRLF can
# leak into files that were authored with LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets that must never be touched.
*.wav      binary
*.png      binary
*.ico      binary
*.icns     binary
*.ttf      binary
*.otf      binary
*.db       binary
*.sqlite   binary
